  "headline": "Jakarta SIM Keliling and Samsat Keliling Schedule November 27 2026",
  "seoTitle": "Jakarta SIM Keliling Schedule November 27 2026",
  "metaDescription": "Polda Metro Jaya provides SIM Keliling in five Jakarta locations and Samsat Keliling across 13 Jadetabek areas for Friday, November 27, 2026.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Polda Metro Jaya is operating mobile driver's license units at five designated locations throughout Jakarta.",
    "Mobile tax collection services for vehicles, known as Samsat Keliling, are available across 13 regions in the Jadetabek area.",
    "These administrative services are provided to facilitate vehicle documentation requirements for residents on Friday, November 27, 2026."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Directorate of Traffic of the Polda Metro Jaya regularly manages mobile administrative services to assist residents with vehicle documentation. On Friday, November 27, 2026, the police have coordinated two types of mobile units to streamline processes for the public. The Surat Izin Mengemudi (SIM) Keliling service is deployed to five specific locations within the capital city to process driver's license renewals. Concurrently, the Sistem Administrasi Manunggal Satu Atap (Samsat) Keliling service, which focuses on annual vehicle tax payments, is stationed across 13 distinct areas throughout the Greater Jakarta (Jadetabek) region. These mobile units are part of a broader ongoing administrative initiative by local law enforcement to improve accessibility to government offices for motor vehicle owners and licensed drivers in the metropolitan area.",
